# ── Godot ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editor cache and reimported assets. Entirely derived from source —
# Godot regenerates this on next open. ~1.1 GB here.
/.godot/
/.import/

# Export configuration holds local paths and signing details.
export_presets.cfg

# Godot's generated C# glue assemblies. Rebuilt from the engine on demand.
/GodotSharp/

# NOTE: *.cs.uid files ARE tracked deliberately. Godot 4.4+ uses them as
# stable script identifiers, and scenes reference scripts by UID — dropping
# them breaks those references for everyone else who clones.

# ── .NET ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
/.mono/
*.user
*.sln.DotSettings.user

# ── Vendored toolchain ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The .NET SDK and the Godot editor binary are kept in the working tree
# for convenience but must never be tracked: together they are ~1.4 GB,
# and Godot_v*.exe alone is 172 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard
# limit — a push containing it would be rejected outright.
/dotnet_sdk/
/Godot_v*.exe

# ── Art assets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Assets/ IS tracked. The old comment here said it was excluded because
# the project had moved to 2D illustrated isometric — that stopped being
# true at the 3D migration and the note was simply stale.
#
# 1.55 GiB across 157 files, all of them under GitHub's 100 MiB per-file
# hard limit. No LFS: the free tier is 1 GB and nothing here needs it once
# the four exceptions below are out.
#
# The four ornate bed exports from Meshy are 103–138 MiB each — over the
# limit, so a push containing any of them is rejected outright. They are
# also absurd as game assets: 138 MiB for something the player sees at a
# couple of hundred pixels behind a cutaway wall. Excluded pending
# replacement with smaller textured models. The small Regal Purple Velvet
# bed in the same folder is 300 KB and IS tracked.
Assets/Furniture/Beds/GLB/Meshy_AI_isolated_ornate_luxur_*.glb

# ── Local tooling and scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────
/.reasonix/
*.tmp
*.log

# ── OS cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
